OL,3,ABurnham to tackle 'mega-donors' in UK
OL,4,Apolitics, minister says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham's government is
OL,7,F"determined to tackle" the issue of
OL,8,F"mega-donors" in UK politics, a
OL,9,Fminister has said in response to calls
OL,10,Ffor an immediate cap on donations.
OL,12,FFlorence Eshalomi said a new team would
OL,13,Fbe "working at pace to find a
OL,14,Fsolution", as some MPs expressed
OL,15,Fconcerns over the influence of wealthy
OL,16,Findividuals donating large sums of
OL,17,Fmoney.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
