OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABurnham to tackle 'mega-donors' in UK
OL,4,Apolitics, minister says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Labour government has already
OL,7,Fcommitted to a #100,000 annual cap on
OL,8,Fdonations from British citizens living
OL,9,Foverseas, but ministers have been
OL,10,Fpressed to go further by introducing a
OL,11,Flimit for UK-based donors.
OL,13,FReform UK's Danny Kruger warned the
OL,14,FRepresentation of the People Bill was a
OL,15,F"flagrantly partisan attempt to
OL,16,Fkneecap" the party.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
